    "enUS": {
      "description": "You cannot understand a single word on this ledger. You don't even know what language it is written in!",
      "dialogue": {
        "0b3fa5607fa43102cbba": "<Narain eagerly examines the letter.>$B$BOutstanding, $R! What is it? I can't read a lick of Draconic.",
        "da12ee819c68d67b8441": "Ooooh! Magical pulsing thingy! For me?"
      },
      "summary": "Deliver Azuregos's Magical Ledger to Narain Soothfancy in Tanaris.",
